{"time": 1762784454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590930551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“贵族，那把你带出去酬劳一定很多吧”"}
